Remote site rules: fetched from /swan/autofill/site-rules (ETag, 15s timeout, login-guarded, cache in chrome.storage.local key SITE_RULES_CACHE_KEY, 15-min alarm, kill switch and enabled flags from /swan/autofill/config); payload has selectorTables, labelPatterns, answerMaps, fieldTypes, params, sites, scrapingRules, ruleVersion, publishedAt; remote rules merge over builtins for adp-recruiting, adp-workforcenow, ashby, greenhouse, lever, myworkday; minExtensionVersion gating; server can disable sites (siteRulesKillSwitch: {site:"off"}) or force fill mode; data-only selectors, not code.
