ATS network scripts install MAIN-world fetch/XHR hooks. Example Workday: arms on click of button[data-automation-id="pageFooterNextButton"]/bottom-navigation-next-button with text Submit/Submit Application; observes POST /wday/cxs/{tenant}/jobapplication/{id}/finalize; requires HTTP 200, JSON id present, no error/errors; dispatches jobright:workday-submission-result with attemptId/applicationId/requestPath/timing; validated in background.
Similar MAIN-world capture scripts exist for BrassRing, ClearCompany, Oracle Cloud, SuccessFactors; they observe network submission confirmations, not form contents.
